Value Required target ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value packets_sent (\d+)
Value packets_received (\d+)
Value loss_pct (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_min_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_avg_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_max_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value rtt_mdev_ms (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^PING\s+${target}\s+\d+\s+data\s+bytes -> Stats

Stats
  ^${packets_sent}\s+packets\s+transmitted,\s+${packets_received}\s+packets\s+received,\s+${loss_pct}%\s+packet\s+loss
  ^round-trip\s+min\s+=\s+${rtt_min_ms}ms,\s+avg\s+=\s+${rtt_avg_ms}ms,\s+max\s+=\s+${rtt_max_ms}ms,\s+stddev\s+=\s+${rtt_mdev_ms}ms -> Record End

End
